# AI QA Wiki .gitignore

## Sensitive Files (Never commit)
*.ke
*.key
*.token
*.env
credentials.json
api_keys.txt
groq_*

## OS Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

## Backup Directory
.backup/
tmp/

## Large Files (>10MB)
*.pdf
*.zip
*.iso

## IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-*

## Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
